+     "  // 16 * nbk; fine = 0 (overhead control): master's N 16 / 32 / 64 / 128 (b = 0 / 1 / 3 / 7). The producer and the\n"
+     "  // consumers call decode_item with the same `fine`: the same bucket (box, tx, consume_item<NB>) on both sides.\n"
+     "  m.bucket = fine ? (m.nbk < 1 ? 0 : (m.nbk > 8 ? 7 : m.nbk - 1))\n"
